@base = http://localhost:9090

### NOTE: run 'Log in' (in the AUTH section below) first; entries use its token.

### Create an entry
POST {{base}}/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Day 1", "body": "Built my first real Go API."}

### List entries
GET {{base}}/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Get one entry (paste an id from the list)
GET {{base}}/entries/PASTE-ENTRY-ID
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Update it
PUT {{base}}/entries/PASTE-ENTRY-ID
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Day 1 (edited)", "body": "Built my first real Go API, with sqlc."}

### Delete it
DELETE {{base}}/entries/PASTE-ENTRY-ID
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### --- These should FAIL ---

### No token → 401
GET {{base}}/entries

### Empty entry → 422
POST {{base}}/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "", "body": "   "}

### Typo in field name → 400
POST {{base}}/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"titel": "oops"}

### Bad id → 400
GET {{base}}/entries/not-a-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### ===== AUTH (Day 2) =====

### Sign up
POST {{base}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"Sushant@example.com","password":"correct-horse-battery","display_name":"Sushant"}

### Log in
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"sushant@example.com","password":"correct-horse-battery"}

### Refresh (paste the refresh_token from the login response). Run it TWICE:
### the second call must return 401 (reuse detection).
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token":"PASTE-REFRESH-TOKEN"}

### Log out
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token":"PASTE-REFRESH-TOKEN"}

### Wrong password -> 401
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"sushant@example.com","password":"wrong-password-here"}

### Duplicate signup -> 409
POST {{base}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"sushant@example.com","password":"correct-horse-battery"}

### Weak password -> 422
POST {{base}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"new@example.com","password":"short"}


### Who am I (needs a token)
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Forged token -> 401
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer not.a.real.token

### Delete my account (permanent!)
DELETE {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}


### ===== SYNC (Day 3) =====

### Push two changes (ids are made up by the device). Dates must not be in the future.
POST {{base}}/sync/push
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"changes":[
  {"id":"11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111","title":"From my phone","body":"Written offline","created_at":"2026-10-30T08:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:00:00Z","deleted_at":null},
  {"id":"22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222","title":"Second","body":"Another one","created_at":"2026-10-30T09:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T09:00:00Z","deleted_at":null}
]}

### Push an OLDER edit of the first entry -> status "stale", nothing changes
POST {{base}}/sync/push
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"changes":[{"id":"11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111","title":"Old edit","body":"Should lose","created_at":"2026-10-30T08:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:00Z","deleted_at":null}]}

### Push a deletion (tombstone) of the second entry
POST {{base}}/sync/push
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"changes":[{"id":"22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222","title":"","body":"","created_at":"2026-10-30T09:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T10:00:00Z","deleted_at":"2026-10-30T10:00:00Z"}]}

### Pull everything since the start
GET {{base}}/sync/pull?since=0
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Pull in small pages (follow next_cursor while has_more is true)
GET {{base}}/sync/pull?since=0&limit=1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
